  "details": "Heyo. This seems like a version-specific bug on desktop for 1390.\n\nAnimations for some avatars are bugged. When walking, running, jumping, or doing custom animations, they seem to freeze up after a certain frame. I made sure each avatar didn't have a custom animation toggled. This even happens after the avatar is reset. Hand gestures cannot be switched on desktop in this state, even if gestures are toggled on.\n\nAvatars tested [not mine]:\n\nVRC Default Robot (working) \n\nBorder Collie (not working): avtr_9d3745f2-a0b0-4b07-b470-5bb32c6e5542\n\nAvatars tested [mine]:\n\nX\n\nX\n\nX [Fallback]\n\nVideo embed: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1185007336507584540\n\nVideo file: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1185007336033636403/2023-12-14_17-45-03.mp4?ex=658e0b15&is=657b9615&hm=683271a38be9edd8ddefaf345dc191d78804ac591da4be2168a9b1c6863f5b71&",
